            <div xml:id="d376">

                <pb facs="0338" n="326" sameAs="frus:frus1942v04/pg326"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">701.9491/17: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State
                        to the Minister in Iran</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Dreyfus</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1942-02-25T13:00:00-04:00">February 25,
                            1942—1 p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>43. Your no. 34, February 8, noon. Please make further inquiries of the Prime
                    Minister as to Iranian intentions respecting continued relations with Japan.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Welles</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
